model new

domain extent -10 10 

wall generate box -8 8

model configure cfd

ball generate radius 0.1 0.4 number 50 box -7 7 -7 7 1 7


ball attribute density 2e3 damp 0.7
cmat default model linear property kn 1e7


cfd read nodes "Node.Dat"
cfd read elements "Elem.Dat"

cfd buoyancy on
element cfd attribute density 1000.0
element cfd attribute viscosity 1.5


element cfd attribute velocity-x 2.0


model mechanical timestep fix 4e-4

model gravity 9.8

model cycle 1

model solve